<title>USA: NewReach buys Maverick for 1.6 mln stock.</title>
<headline>NewReach buys Maverick for 1.6 mln stock.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD BEACH, Fla. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Database development company NewReach Communications Inc said on Friday it acquired creative development firm Maverick Ltd for 1.6 million NewReach shares.</p>
<p>The company said it issued authorized but unissued post split common shares for all outstanding Maverick shares.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
